cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this library, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Network Protocols Expert: an expert-level network protocol learning library"
abstract: >-
  One self-contained HTML page per network protocol, in French, English, Dutch and German:
  RFC-style bit diagrams and Wireshark-style trees for every message type, animated
  exchanges, multi-vendor configuration with sourced commands, troubleshooting and quizzes.
authors:
